{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01868","headline":"杂曲歌辞 爱妾换马 二 · 张祜","name":"杂曲歌辞 爱妾换马 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绮阁香销华厩空，忍将行雨换追风。\n休怜柳叶双眉翠，却爱桃花两耳红。\n侍宴永辞春色里，趁朝休立漏声中。\n恩劳未尽情先尽，暗泣嘶风两意同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}